 "title": "Spain's French Tank Secret",
 "cat": "history",
 "emoji": "🪖",
 "sentences": [
  "Spain once built its own French tank.",
  "The AMX-30E was Spain's first mass-produced tank.",
  "Originally, the Spanish government actually wanted to buy the German Leopard 1 instead.",
  "They chose the AMX-30 because it was cheaper and easier to build locally.",
  "Santa Bárbara Sistemas manufactured 280 units between 1974 and 1983.",
  "This project eventually paved the way for Spain to produce the modern Leopard 2E."
